## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a real-time, resource-constrained ICA system with edge computing constraints and privacy-preserving requirements.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming ICA in fixed-point arithmetic
- Online joint diagonalization algorithms
- Quantization-latency trade-offs
- Privacy-preserving statistics sharing
- Real-time signal processing on embedded hardware

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode outline for streaming ICA pipeline
function streamingICA(micSignals) {
  // Fixed-point whitening with running statistics
  const whitened = fixedPointWhiten(micSignals);
  // Online joint diagonalization with SGD
  const separationMatrix = onlineJointDiag(whitened);
  // 8-bit quantized updates
  return quantizeUpdate(separationMatrix);
}
```

